<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W AUG NET RISES TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W AUG NET RISES TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.89 vs   2.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.97 vs   3.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.10 vs   3.56</p>
<p> Sales		   23.50 vs  20.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.01 vs  13.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	28.00 vs  21.30</p>
